  "description": "Frede, the most handsome bachelor of the empire is marrying Ayla, the only daughter of the powerful duke and a notoriously selfish woman. As much as he is unwilling, Frede is caught off guard when Ayla, who had been swooning over him, offers a deal to end the marriage after one year. Confused with her change in heart and softened attitude, Frede now struggles with a growing urge to stop the fated divorce. \n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)\n\n*Note: First released in English, with the initial eligible release in Japanese followed by Korean, making it a manga by our standards.*",
